# public/brand/, public/creative/, public/sales-playbook/ are refreshed from the
# monorepo by scripts/sync-brand-assets.mjs on predev/prebuild. They are
# committed because Railway builds the service from 02_services/mission-control/
# in isolation and cannot reach ../../04_brand/, ../../05_creative/, or
# ../../10_sales/, so the committed mirror is the fallback that ships in
# production.
